const ws=document.createElement('main');ws.id='trozalImageCodeVideoWorkspace';ws.innerHTML='<div class="shell"><section class="panel"><div class="row"><h2 style="flex:1">IMAGE TO CODE VIDEO</h2><button id="itcvBack">← Kembali</button></div><p>Mode mandiri di luar Mode Profesional. Ubah gambar raster menjadi video HTML mandiri dengan CSS @keyframes yang ramah importer. JavaScript source tetap tersedia terpisah sebagai opsi lanjutan.</p><label>Gambar sumber (maksimal 3)</label><input id="itcvFiles" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" multiple><div class="thumbs" id="itcvThumbs"></div><label>MODEL AI VISION LOKAL (OLLAMA)</label><div class="row"><select id="itcvVisionModel"><option value="">Memuat model Vision…</option></select><button id="itcvRefreshVision" type="button">↻ Refresh</button></div><label>Context AI (token)</label><select id="itcvContext"><option value="4096" selected>4096 · Rekomendasi RAM 16 GB</option><option value="8192">8192 · Lebih detail, lebih berat</option></select><p style="font-size:10px">Jika analisis melewati batas konteks, sistem mencoba ulang dengan prompt ringkas.</p><div class="actions"><button id="itcvTestVision" type="button">UJI MODEL VISION</button><span id="itcvVisionStatus" style="font-size:10px;color:#a9dbea">Periksa model lokal yang mendukung gambar.</span></div><p style="font-size:10px">Model rekomendasi: <b>qwen2.5vl:3b</b>. Jika belum terpasang, jalankan <code>ollama pull qwen2.5vl:3b</code> di terminal, lalu Refresh. Tidak ada unduhan otomatis.</p><section class="rig-panel"><h3>◈ UNIVERSAL OBJECT RIG · SAM 2.1 TINY</h3><p>Untuk manusia, hewan, kendaraan, mesin, tanaman, produk, logo, dan objek lain. Segmentasi piksel berjalan lokal di PC; Ollama Vision memberi nama dan saran gerakan.</p><div class="actions"><button type="button" id="itcvRigCheck">Cek Segmenter Lokal</button><button type="button" class="primary" id="itcvRigAuto">AI Segmentasi Komponen</button></div><div id="itcvRigStatus" class="rig-status" style="font-size:10px;color:#bfe8dc;margin:7px 0">Segmenter SAM 2.1 belum diperiksa. Jalankan setup dan server lokal terlebih dahulu.</div><label>Preview sumber · klik untuk memisahkan satu komponen</label><canvas id="itcvRigSource" width="640" height="360"></canvas><div id="itcvRigMaskControls" class="rig-mask-controls"><label class="rig-mask-toggle"><input id="itcvRigMaskOverlay" type="checkbox" checked> Tampilkan overlay mask</label><label>Opasitas overlay <span id="itcvRigMaskOpacityValue">42%</span><input id="itcvRigMaskOpacity" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="42"></label><label>Fokus komponen<select id="itcvRigMaskFocus"><option value="all">Semua komponen</option></select></label><label class="rig-mask-toggle"><input id="itcvRigShowBounds" type="checkbox" checked> Tampilkan kotak batas</label></div><div id="itcvRigPointTools" class="rig-point-tools"><strong>Multi-Point SAM Prompt</strong><p>Tambahkan beberapa titik agar SAM membedakan objek dan latar secara lebih akurat.</p><div class="actions"><button id="itcvRigPointPositive" type="button">＋ Titik Positif</button><button id="itcvRigPointNegative" type="button">− Titik Negatif</button><button id="itcvRigPointUndo" type="button">Undo Titik Terakhir</button><button id="itcvRigPointClear" type="button">Hapus Titik</button></div><div class="actions"><button id="itcvRigPointRun" type="button" class="primary">Segmentasi Titik</button><span id="itcvRigPointHint">0 titik</span></div></div><div class="row"><div><label>Nama komponen</label><input id="itcvRigPartName" value="Komponen baru" placeholder="Roda depan, kelopak bunga..."></div><div><label>Gerakan</label><select id="itcvRigPartMotion"><option value="swing">Swing / Ayun</option><option value="hinge">Hinge / Engsel</option><option value="wheel">Wheel / Putar</option><option value="rotate">Rotate / Rotasi</option><option value="bob">Bob / Naik turun</option><option value="float">Float / Melayang</option><option value="pulse">Pulse / Skala</option><option value="static">Tetap</option></select></div></div><div class="actions"><button type="button" id="itcvRigPickMode">＋ Klik gambar untuk tambah komponen</button><button type="button" id="itcvRigBuild" disabled>Bangun Universal Rig</button></div><div class="rig-count" id="itcvRigCount">0 komponen tersegmentasi</div><div id="itcvRigParts" class="rig-parts"></div></section><label>Gaya animasi</label><select id="itcvStyle"><option value="cinematic">Cinematic camera push, pan, parallax, light</option><option value="product">Premium product commercial</option><option value="dynamic">Dynamic camera and energy particles</option><option value="dream">Dreamlike floating camera and glow</option><option value="editorial">Clean editorial camera slide</option></select><label>Instruksi gerakan tambahan</label><textarea id="itcvPrompt" rows="3" placeholder="Arah kamera, suasana, gerakan objek..."></textarea><div class="row"><div><label>Durasi (detik)</label><input id="itcvDuration" type="number" min="2" max="60" value="8"></div><div><label>FPS</label><select id="itcvFps"><option>24</option><option selected>30</option><option>60</option></select></div></div><div class="row"><div><label>Rasio video</label><select id="itcvRatio"><option value="16:9">16:9 Landscape</option><option value="9:16">9:16 Portrait</option><option value="1:1">1:1 Square</option><option value="4:5">4:5 Social</option></select></div><div><label>Gambar</label><select id="itcvFit"><option value="contain">Utuh / Tidak terpotong</option><option value="cover">Isi kanvas / Crop</option></select></div></div><div class="actions"><button class="primary" id="itcvGenerate">✦ ANALISIS & GENERATE</button><button id="itcvTemplate">Animasi dasar</button></div><div id="itcvStatus" class="status">Pilih gambar raster. Preview memakai rasio terpilih dan animasi nyata.</div></section><section class="panel"><div class="preview"><div class="row"><strong style="flex:1">LIVE VIDEO PREVIEW</strong><span id="itcvMeta">16:9 · 30 FPS</span><button id="itcvPlay">Ⅱ Pause</button></div><iframe id="itcvPreview" title="Image to video preview" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin"></iframe></div><div class="actions" style="margin-top:10px"><button class="primary" id="itcvRenderVideo">🎬 RENDER VIDEO MP4</button><span id="itcvRenderHint" style="font-size:10px;color:#a9dbea">Render dari frame preview · H.264</span></div><div class="out"><label>AI SCENE PLAN INSPECTOR</label><textarea id="itcvScenePlan" readonly spellcheck="false" placeholder="Hasil analisis scene dan lapisan gerak AI akan muncul di sini."></textarea><div class="actions"><button id="itcvDownloadScene" type="button">Download Scene JSON</button></div></div><div class="out"><label>HTML VIDEO OUTPUT · CSS @KEYFRAMES (IMPORTER-SAFE)</label><textarea id="itcvHtml" spellcheck="false"></textarea><div class="actions"><button class="primary" id="itcvCopyHtml">Copy HTML</button><button id="itcvDownloadHtml">Download HTML</button></div></div><div class="out"><label>JAVASCRIPT SOURCE (OPSIONAL · BUKAN UNTUK HTML IMPORTER)</label><textarea id="itcvJs" spellcheck="false"></textarea><div class="actions"><button class="primary" id="itcvCopyJs">Copy JavaScript</button><button id="itcvDownloadJs">Download JavaScript</button></div></div></section></div>';document.body.append(ws);
